# Enforce LF in the repo so checkouts work identically on macOS, Linux, and
# Windows regardless of each contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# CRITICAL: examples/scripts/sxt.mjs is an npm bin entry — if its
# `#!/usr/bin/env node` shebang line ever lands with a CRLF ending, the global
# `sxt` command breaks on macOS/Linux with "env: node\r: No such file or
# directory". eol=lf on *.mjs makes that impossible.

* text=auto

*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.sol text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
